            {
              "type": "input_text",
              "text": "<evidence id=\"E1\" sha256=\"3b6d1fb084cfd5fbb618e100f35b14c3c715b52feb7b3461e5833e09de5c3c91\" kind=\"text\" label=\"scope evidence\">\nMobile app UI design brief\nBuyer: Mira Saluna\nSeller: Danu Wirasa, independent designer based in Indonesia\n\nI need a clean interface for a fictional neighborhood plant-care app. The agreed deliverable is six mobile app UI screens, supplied as editable design files and exported images. The screens should cover welcome, plant list, plant details, watering schedule, reminders, and settings.\n\nPlease use a soft green and cream palette, readable type, and simple icons. One round of visual revisions is included after I review the first draft. The agreed fee for the complete work is EUR 480. We have not set a delivery deadline; please discuss timing with me before starting.\n</evidence>"
            }
          ]
